## 5) De-dup and precedence rule
Use this precedence when the same action appears in multiple sources:
1. `claude-jsonl` / `codex-rollout` = canonical transcript
2. `codex-sqlite` = fallback/enrichment
3. `codex-history` / `codex-tui` = auxiliary only

Suggested fingerprint:
`runtimeType + localSessionId + kind + toolName + floor(ts/1000) + hash(summary-prefix)`

